  "body": "## vLLM-Omni Q3 Roadmap\n\n### 1. Real-Time Full-Duplex Model Productionization\n- [ ] Target models: JoyVL, MiniCPM-o, etc.\n- [ ] Support reliable real-time full-duplex serving flow\n- [ ] Add reproducible demos/examples\n\n### 2. World Model Support and Diffusion Generation Serving\n- [ ] Target models: Cosmos3, DreamZero, Helios, HYImage3, Lingbot series, etc.\n- [ ] Implement missing runtime/model support\n- [ ] Kernels:\n    - [ ] FastVideo kernels\n    - [ ] Compute&Comm fused kernels\n- [ ] Build diffusion KV cache manager\n- [ ] Parallelism: DP/EP/PP supports\n\n### 3. RL Integration\n- [ ] Batch Invariance Compute\n\n### 4. Core Architecture Refactor for large scale serving efficiency and long-term maintenance https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4843\n- [ ] config system\n- [ ] benchmarks\n- [ ] logger system\n- [ ] Clean up core runtime paths: \n    - [ ] entrypoint\n    - [ ] orchestrator\n    - [ ] Omni/AsyncOmniEngine\n    - [ ] scheduler\n    - [ ] worker/modelrunner\n    - [ ] connector\n- [ ] Refactor diffusion runtime paths:\n    - [ ] DiffusionEngine: including streaming\n    - [ ] Parallelism\n    - [ ] DiTCache\n    - [ ] Offloading\n    - [ ] Quantization\n- [ ] Align parallelism behavior across different stages\n    \n### 5. Model File Cleanup and Onboarding Standardization for Omni/TTS/Diffusion models\n- [ ] Clean up model file structure under model_executor\n- [ ] Define standard model onboarding strategy \n- [ ] Add contributor-facing docs/checklists/examples\n- [ ] Update to vllm recipe\n\n### 6. vLLM-Omni Copilot\n- [ ] Automate daily alignment with vLLM upstream commits\n- [ ] Build systematic AI PR review workflow, e.g., https://github.com/fmagent-project/FM-Agent\n- [ ] Build automatic debugging workflow for CI/runtime failures\n- [ ] Keep specs and skills updated from recurring development patterns\n",
